* AD4021 20-bit SAR ADC digitizing a 1 V DC input
.lib AD4021.sub

* Analog input
VIN     IN      0       DC 1
CIN     IN      0       2.7n

* ADC core and digital-interface supplies
VDD1    VDD     0       DC 1.8
CVDD1   VDD     0       100n
CVDD2   VDD     0       10u

VIO1    VIO     0       DC 1.8
CVIO1   VIO     0       100n
CVIO2   VIO     0       1u

* Precision 5 V reference and local bypassing
VREF1   REF     0       DC 5
CREF1   REF     0       100n
CREF2   REF     0       10u

* CNV rising edge starts conversion; falling edge enables readout
VCNV    CNV     0       PULSE(0 1.8 100n 1n 1n 349n 10u)

* Twenty 50 MHz serial-clock cycles begin after conversion completes
VSCK    SCK     0       PULSE(0 1.8 500n 1n 1n 8n 20n)

* Select the three-wire serial mode
RSDI    SDI    VIO     10

* Representative digital-output loading
COUT    OUT     0       5p
ROUT    OUT     0       100k

* Pin order follows the AD4021 package:
* REF VDD IN+ IN- GND VIO SDO SCK SDI CNV
XU1     REF VDD IN 0 0 VIO OUT SCK SDI CNV AD4021

.options plotwinsize=0
.tran 0 900n 0 250p

.end
